# Tier bench (tools/engine-tier-bench.mjs): Learn › Barbs, left alone (a seeded
# dish with no rivals, so the idle cell survives however the windowed run's
# ticks fall against its frames): 600 measured frames of the live dish
# (barbs, motes, pellets, plankton, the caustic floor, shadows and bloom).
until 300 Play
frames 30
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Learn
until 60 Barbs
frames 10
click Barbs
until 30 Rank 1/1
frames 120
measure start
frames 600
measure stop
expect Mass 20 / 90
